WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.004
Day 1. Find the Starting Point.

2
00:00:02.454 --> 00:00:06.043
Day one is a check, not a lesson. It shows where to start.

3
00:00:06.643 --> 00:00:10.306
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the writing page.

4
00:00:10.756 --> 00:00:18.506
Part A: your child copies a sentence. Part B: you say a sentence twice, and your child writes it. Do not spell any word.

5
00:00:19.106 --> 00:00:23.676
Part C: your child writes a sentence about the picture. It is their own idea.

6
00:00:24.276 --> 00:00:31.687
For each part, mark the five things on your page: the capital, the spaces, the period, every word there, and reading it back.

7
00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:37.961
Then read the box at the bottom, and stop at the first line that fits. Keep the page for day ten.
